jei.enchanter_tools.arcane_brazier.desc=Arcane Braziers burn Enchanted Books to prevent enchantments from appearing in in nearby enchanting tables. Active braziers can also burn matching enchantments off Enchanted items.
jei.enchanter_tools.enchanted_eight_ball.desc=Enchanted 8 Balls are a treasure containing a random enchantment, and can be used for fortune-telling.
jei.enchanter_tools.enchanted_inkwell.desc=Enchanted Inkwells copy their enchantments into Enchanted Books.
jei.enchanter_tools.extracting_book.desc=Extracting Books extract the first enchantment from an enchanted item and transfer it into an Enchanted Book.
jei.enchanter_tools.lapis_rune.desc=Lapis Runes influence the enchantments available in an enchanting table. Each rune favors specific enchantments or item categories.
jei.enchanter_tools.pondering_orb.desc=Pondering Orbs passively grant experience to nearby players looking at it. Interacting with the orb will reroll enchanting table enchantments.